{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52242","headline":"诗（幷序） 三 · 王梵志","name":"诗（幷序） 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"家口总死尽，吾死无亲表（张改作「衰」，郭校作「哀」）。\n急首卖（一作「买」）资产，与设逆修斋。\n托生得好处，身死雇人埋。\n钱财隣保出，任你自相差。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52242.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52242","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}